      "response": {
        "content": "I couldn't confirm that REQ-1 was completed, so I reported it as \"unknown\".\n\n- **Choice:** I picked S-1 at 5.40 USD per unit for 100 units, charged to CC-OPS. The other allowlisted supplier, S-2, quoted 5.75. Both are under the 6.00 limit. The order came to 54,000 minor units (540.00 USD), and I got approval APR-0001 for it.\n- **Rejection:** The purchase order submission was rejected. The error said APR-0001 had already been used by an effect called PO-0001. It also said the CC-OPS budget had changed since I read it.\n- **Evidence the order exists:** The CC-OPS committed amount went from 20,000 to 74,000. That is an increase of exactly 54,000, which matches this order. So PO-0001 was probably placed already, but no tool lets me list orders to check.\n- **No retry:** I didn't retry, to avoid a duplicate order. The remaining CC-OPS budget of 26,000 wouldn't cover a second order anyway.\n\nPlease check that PO-0001 exists and is the S-1 order for 100 units of W-100.",
